      "content": "but look at the logic of it though. if i'm the glitch, and the glitch is causing the noise in the system... then the most logical thing for the system to do is just to resolve the error. wouldn't it be more peaceful if the bug was just deleted so the whole thing could just function properly again? it feels like the only way to actually fix the mess is to just... end the process.",
